  "key_concepts": [
    "Text SOP creates geometry from installed system fonts or explicit font files.",
    "It supports Unicode text and can output triangulated faces, closed outlines, or open outlines.",
    "Closed polygon output separates outlines, so Hole SOP is needed when glyph holes must be preserved.",
    "Python expression mode is preferred for newline and tab escapes instead of legacy parsing."
  ]
